    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44242" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκῑν-ησία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ease of motion,
			mobility</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.37.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				5.27.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροχιλιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					49.4.34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Cael.</u>
					662.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Artemo
					12
				</span></i>
			; <i>mobility</i> of troops, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.26.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.49
			</span></i> (pl.): generally, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				287
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mobility</i> of mind, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ψυχῆς αἱ εὐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					1p.20U.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.72
			</span></i> W., <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				32.1
			</span></i>.</div>
